## Summary

Turn PAL clink route selection into a real executed embedded-audit verdict: run the proven claude-audit/gemini-audit clink config against an evidence bundle, capture PAL_CLINK_AUDIT_OUTPUT.json, and normalize it into a real embedded_audit proof object (PASS/PASS_WITH_RISKS/FAIL/NEEDS_SUPERVISOR/SKIPPED), closing the PASS_WITH_BLOCKERS gap left by TP-DMX-AUDITOR-ROUTER-PAL-CLINK-002.

## Scope

Allowlist-bound; see commit.allowlist. Out of scope: Do not create new PAL cli_clients configs (only claude-audit and gemini-audit). Do not add Copilot clink support (deferred). Do not remove or change schemas/proof/embedded_audit.schema.json enum values (supervisor red-lane).

## Validation

See commit.verify; embedded audit + proof bundle required.

